# Glacier Mouth (CIPlay glacier_mouth): the depot, the orders, the bears, the drill rig, the leader's chest, the
# Ringwave (camera) and its note, the cave mouth chest.
island Glacier Mouth
# RESIZE 10-24: the recipe moved this island's old content by 0 -24.8; the points below are in the old frame
offset 0 24.8
expect step 0
expect title The Glacier
zone depot
expect step 1
read Expedition orders
expect step 2
kill Polar bear
expect step 3
expect hidden drillrig
use drillhead
expect story drilled 0
open Depot stores
open Torn sled
open Old camp crate
wait 3
expect story drillbit 3
expect step 4
use drillhead
expect story drillbit 0
expect shown drillrig
expect step 5
open Drill rig chest
wait 3
expect step 6
open Leader's chest
wait 3
expect step 7
# DEEP 10-24: the Icefall, the survey mast, the crevasse collapse, the snowcat's key
zone icefall
expect step 8
zone glacier_top
expect step 9
read Survey log
expect step 10
expect shown icelid
expect hidden icerubble
zone crevasse
wait 8
expect hidden icelid
expect shown icerubble
expect step 11
air snowair
open Survey snowcat's box
wait 3
expect story surveykey 1
expect step 12
zone ringwave
wait 6
read Carving note
expect step 13
open Cave mouth chest
wait 3
expect done
# the extras: the mast chest, the ice cave cache, three treasures
open Survey mast chest
open Ice cave cache
dig 0
dig 1
dig 2
